# Learn more https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/getting-started-with-git/ignoring-files

# dependencies
node_modules/

# Expo
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
expo-env.d.ts

# Native
.kotlin/
*.orig.*
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision

# Metro
.metro-health-check*

# debug
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*

# macOS
.DS_Store
*.pem

# local env files
.env
.env*.local

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# generated native folders (expo prebuild output)
apps/mobile/ios/
apps/mobile/android/

# Unity
unity-avatar/UnityAvatarProject/Library/
unity-avatar/UnityAvatarProject/Temp/
unity-avatar/UnityAvatarProject/Obj/
unity-avatar/UnityAvatarProject/Build/
unity-avatar/UnityAvatarProject/Logs/
unity-avatar/UnityAvatarProject/UserSettings/
unity-avatar/UnityAvatarProject/*.csproj
unity-avatar/UnityAvatarProject/*.sln
unity-avatar/UnityAvatarProject/*.suo
# Note: uaal-export/ actually lands inside the UnityAvatarProject submodule
# (its own .gitignore excludes it there) — this parent .gitignore can't see
# into a submodule's working tree anyway, so there's nothing to add here.

# G2P lexicon build cache (downloaded CMUdict + frequency lists)
unity-avatar/tools/.lexicon-cache/

# Source documents: commit only when the licence permits redistribution
content/sources/*
!content/sources/MANIFEST.md

# pre-prune DB backups (bulky, reproducible) — keep local, do not commit
docs/report/backup/

# Study data — participant records never enter the repository.
# See docs/study/ethics/data-management-plan.md §6: transcripts are not shared
# with the project partner, not committed, and not published.
docs/study/results/

# MS Office lock files
~$*
**/~$*

# Web build
apps/web/dist/
apps/web/public/unity/Build/

# Gradle build caches. apps/mobile/android/ is already ignored wholesale above,
# but the
# UaaL module keeps its own android/ tree that is committed, so ignore the
# regenerable .gradle cache and build output inside it (and any future one) by
# name. Trailing slashes matter: `build/` is generated output, while the
# sibling `build.gradle` is source and must stay tracked.
.gradle/
**/android/build/
